{"2683200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Paupers", "steam_appid": 2683200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683200/extras/f838fb128b5c63492ba76b29a68f1d07.avif?t=1772142022\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br><strong>Step into the whimsical and eerie world of The Paupers (formerly Dziady)!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👻</h2>In this game, you play as a spectral custodian helping souls transition to the afterlife. Explore a realm filled with lost spirits, each with their unique stories and needs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👂</h2>In <i>The Paupers</i>, you'll become an expert in <strong>spectral listening</strong>, tuning into the odd requests of these ghosts. Your task is to meet their bizarre needs, from providing an alcoholic drink to finding a long-lost comfort food.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕊️</h2><i>The Paupers</i> is a blend of empathy, cleverness, and a bit of spookiness. Interacting with the spirits reveals layers of untold stories. It's not just about handing over items, but about understanding their past and helping them find peace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎃</h2>Don't worry, though – <strong>it's not all serious!</strong> The game is <u>perfect for Halloween</u>, mixing spooky moments with fun and humor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683200/extras/877f0de14d53f7a813311b28f639be26.poster.avif?t=1772142022\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683200/extras/877f0de14d53f7a813311b28f639be26.webm?t=1772142022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Dynamic spirit encounters:</strong> Interact with unique spirits, each with their own backstory and requirements. Challenge yourself with Noonwraith riddles and banish skeletons through portals.<br></li><li> <strong>Arcade gameplay:</strong> Explore a stylized, supernatural world, dodging dangers. Banish ghosts to earn spectral coins, enhancing your journey.<br></li><li> <strong>Unlockable powers and gameplay enhancements:</strong> Gain new abilities and gameplay modifiers to diversify your experience. Unlock and decorate the crypt, a cozy retreat that offers you additional benefits.<br></li><li> <strong>Halloween-Themed Fun:</strong> Experience a mix of spooky and humorous elements, true to the Halloween spirit.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683200/extras/f838fb128b5c63492ba76b29a68f1d07.avif?t=1772142022\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br><strong>Step into the whimsical and eerie world of The Paupers (formerly Dziady)!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👻</h2>In this game, you play as a spectral custodian helping souls transition to the afterlife. Explore a realm filled with lost spirits, each with their unique stories and needs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👂</h2>In <i>The Paupers</i>, you'll become an expert in <strong>spectral listening</strong>, tuning into the odd requests of these ghosts. Your task is to meet their bizarre needs, from providing an alcoholic drink to finding a long-lost comfort food.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕊️</h2><i>The Paupers</i> is a blend of empathy, cleverness, and a bit of spookiness. Interacting with the spirits reveals layers of untold stories. It's not just about handing over items, but about understanding their past and helping them find peace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎃</h2>Don't worry, though – <strong>it's not all serious!</strong> The game is <u>perfect for Halloween</u>, mixing spooky moments with fun and humor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a